mutation_test_junit_real.xml — six <testcase>s cut from a real report.

Captured 2026-09-20 from `dart run mutation_test -f junit` (mutation_test 1.8.1) on orcweather
(662 mutants, 255 survived). The real shape differs from the hand-built mutation_test_junit.xml:
name= is "Line<N>_<mutator>_<k>", classname= is the file, and the survivor's file, line, original
and mutated code are in the <failure> element's text ("File: … / Line: … / Original line: … /
Mutation: …"), spanning several lines when the statement does. mutation_test exits -1 (255) when
any mutant survived. BACKLOG #71.
